Say what a run would measure, without measuring it

Usage: njutest plan [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --directory <DIR>  The workspace to plan for. The working directory by default
  -p, --package <NAME>   Plan only this package. Repeatable
      --why              Say what put each target in scope
      --offline          Pass --offline to every cargo command
      --locked           Pass --locked to every cargo command
  -h, --help             Print help
